abstract: >-
  Publication companion for a conditional computer-assisted comparison:
  assuming every nontrivial Riemann zeta zero has real part at most 7/8,
  Λ ≤ 0.116397726408291 < 0.116398 in the Polymath normalisation.
  The numerical checks do not establish the zero-free hypothesis.
  No unconditional record, RH proof or independent peer-review certification
  is asserted. Original published files and their checksums are preserved.
